    "detailed_description": "<h1>Now on Kickstarter!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/bc2f95588f3f48a91ab8bee5e4f798c0.avif?t=1727797453\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/95710e69c3c0c404bd438953acc9baec.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=401 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This little guy has been having a <i>ruff</i> time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s about time he started working through his issues in\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is Fine \u2013 Maximum Cope!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In This Is Fine \u2013 Maximum Cope your worries aren't just in your head anymore, they've taken physical form, transforming your neighbourhood into several surreal, anxiety-themed realms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026Each featuring as exciting areas to explore and conquer, linked together in an interconnected map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/f79ec86db519a39993d2765428be16c3.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=438 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate these worlds, you'll encounter a variety of enemies, each an embodiment of everyday worries. Fight off these enemies and traverse hazardous environments, with a toolbox of special abilities such as dog breath and heli-chops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/a9fc3c25b6a307b6102b73d2f0b720f2.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=461 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the real challenge lies in facing the anxiety bosses themselves. Towering manifestation of your deepest fears. Defeat them like the anxiety conquering warrior you are and capture their essence in an anxiety box, Ghostbusters style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuffing a boss into its anxiety box unlocks new abilities for your character, allowing you to explore new areas and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/f9ef2e991e50bac01ea8fe885cf81302.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=395 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to face the perils of your own subconscious? Will you ever finally enjoy another cup of coffee in peace?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/6261f4874695390eb6a1ae2dcaeecfb1.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/0605e27a4bb0bcbe4e8ac322530d33ff.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/a13572b3f84a9f0a54a78063673a9e64.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/b9e509efc3e6723cdd1589e870ccfee1.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=184 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/95710e69c3c0c404bd438953acc9baec.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=401 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This little guy has been having a <i>ruff</i> time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s about time he started working through his issues in\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is Fine \u2013 Maximum Cope!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In This Is Fine \u2013 Maximum Cope your worries aren't just in your head anymore, they've taken physical form, transforming your neighbourhood into several surreal, anxiety-themed realms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026Each featuring as exciting areas to explore and conquer, linked together in an interconnected map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/f79ec86db519a39993d2765428be16c3.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=438 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate these worlds, you'll encounter a variety of enemies, each an embodiment of everyday worries. Fight off these enemies and traverse hazardous environments, with a toolbox of special abilities such as dog breath and heli-chops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/a9fc3c25b6a307b6102b73d2f0b720f2.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=461 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the real challenge lies in facing the anxiety bosses themselves. Towering manifestation of your deepest fears. Defeat them like the anxiety conquering warrior you are and capture their essence in an anxiety box, Ghostbusters style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuffing a boss into its anxiety box unlocks new abilities for your character, allowing you to explore new areas and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/f9ef2e991e50bac01ea8fe885cf81302.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=395 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have the courage to face the perils of your own subconscious? Will you ever finally enjoy another cup of coffee in peace?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/6261f4874695390eb6a1ae2dcaeecfb1.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/0605e27a4bb0bcbe4e8ac322530d33ff.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/a13572b3f84a9f0a54a78063673a9e64.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3229980/extras/b9e509efc3e6723cdd1589e870ccfee1.avif?t=1727797453\" width=680 height=184 /></span></p>",
